---
import company from "../../data/company.json";
import Button from "../ui/Button.astro";
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../ui/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="bg-white py-24 sm:py-32">
  <Container>
    <SectionHeading eyebrow="公司简介" title="自 1998 年起，专注钢结构建筑的建造与施工。" description={company.description} align="center" />
    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-7">
        <span class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[#d9e7f0] font-extrabold text-[var(--color-primary)]">01</span>
        <h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-extrabold">超高层钢结构</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--color-muted)]">承担地下结构、裙房与塔楼主体的钢结构建造与施工，代表项目建筑高度超过 340 米。</p>
        <a href="/products/super-high-rise-steel-building/" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-extrabold text-[var(--color-primary)]">了解业务 </a>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-7">
        <span class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[#d7eee3] font-extrabold text-[#1c7a52]">02</span>
        <h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-extrabold">大跨度空间钢结构</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--color-muted)]">面向体育场馆、会展中心等大空间建筑，承担空间管桁架屋盖等大跨度钢结构工程。</p>
        <a href="/products/long-span-space-steel-building/" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-extrabold text-[var(--color-primary)]">了解业务 </a>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-7">
        <span class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[#e6ecf2] font-extrabold text-[#3d5a70]">03</span>
        <h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-extrabold">装配式钢结构</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--color-muted)]">以装配式钢结构轻板建筑体系为核心，按标准化设计、工厂化制作、装配化施工组织建造。</p>
        <a href="/products/prefabricated-steel-building/" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-extrabold text-[var(--color-primary)]">了解业务 </a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-[var(--color-ink)] p-8 text-white sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg text-white/70">公司同时发展钢结构城市运营建筑产品与钢结构别墅住宅产品，并在项目中持续应用装配式钢结构轻板建筑体系。</p>
      <Button href="/about/" variant="inverse" class="shrink-0">了解公司</Button>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
